  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d62eb280d6e365d0cd83bed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总算，爬到这个位置了呢。\n绝不允许迟到。一起分享喜悦吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5da4f64dfa3dd75c309a3f173cde3ad9ec7a42a082461543fafa4550351491",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88518231711ef2c07d01696b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的！抬神轿也会有好兆头！\\n我今天会用祭典的力量拿下胜利给大家看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b4405180b8d0b2234f1c4ae3f7438cad9a0421f927191c05d2eba4e5593780b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d007a7d4c9145b488bf0fb7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是天下，但这里不需要。\n本大将要不断赢下胜仗，总有一天会亲手夺取的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d4877afd28b7bfbef603716261c04bf31346e51bc90bb26de87fbf5ba46c77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56ae468dc6f54cc2ebb0bf20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总算，爬到这个位置了呢。\n绝不允许迟到。一起分享喜悦吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5da4f64dfa3dd75c309a3f173cde3ad9ec7a42a082461543fafa4550351491",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d9e635dfb064676dc42064",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是，尊敬的父亲和首领。\n胸怀正义，我完成了使命……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00f54181e3450b992d7c0c4c58dab57083ad15dcb49810054cec236293de5c13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b55324155103a1a9124081d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了防止有人得意忘形大吵大闹，\n本官会负责巡逻的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5489ab39d9e917cbe13dc73dcfc1bd813e334cce6bb9d68564278dc858bc959d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe24dda8b4766c4fdc4dd11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是『贯彻自己所坚信的正义』。\n希望他们能走上正确的道路，实现梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f623114b00b1d0108ca5ab29e4017664123f713662704ce2f4cf25be247cf3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5271bf222297753ee2ee469a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那真是太感谢了。但是，\n太过兴奋容易受伤。还请克制一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68f310f65be8be7f6261b8faf33d2694b6d5ebc9b6192c7bdd028a07eff88e8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5892513d472fe8b351371ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是『胜利，逮捕！！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d2d3db6706f2926d36231f298ad5891eda255b597d09d56ce89d87bcf214468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b1a8a83854da6a82c2333e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是『贯彻自己所坚信的正义』。\n希望他们能走上正确的道路，实现梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f623114b00b1d0108ca5ab29e4017664123f713662704ce2f4cf25be247cf3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564c258bd94c7d5df30b46c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那真是太感谢了。但是，\n太过兴奋容易受伤。还请克制一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68f310f65be8be7f6261b8faf33d2694b6d5ebc9b6192c7bdd028a07eff88e8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:361ac86e83a93c9e27404a12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是『胜利，逮捕！！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d2d3db6706f2926d36231f298ad5891eda255b597d09d56ce89d87bcf214468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1369"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7be156341bb924ac6aaf6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这本笔记本里充满了我日积月累的努力……\\n所以或许就像你讲的那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c62414afe2381ca404148e869c87399d805697bb435a8084ca964c74238223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49755ccea782656aaa10dd74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "消除不安正是本官的职责，\n所以不安什么的……嗯，一点都没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd6b99f2b4586a12866cea4b67c3a5fc5f9d8bcf9f4bc20d523c5b32d557eb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1370"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d674a0d0a8d3af4af40154af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，感慨万千。我用坦荡的奔跑\n回应了肩负未来的孩子们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e14006d7baa018df2d183d70b4f5becb39dc765a23a177e960576d9ab598175c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a610e73bbe974fa5e1078305",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "消除不安正是本官的职责，\n所以不安什么的……嗯，一点都没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd6b99f2b4586a12866cea4b67c3a5fc5f9d8bcf9f4bc20d523c5b32d557eb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623372ebb22513833a0fce4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，感慨万千。我用坦荡的奔跑\n回应了肩负未来的孩子们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e14006d7baa018df2d183d70b4f5becb39dc765a23a177e960576d9ab598175c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec61d88b58791aa6ba7729f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你。但是，我的目标\n始终是夺冠——即『顶点』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c21d7a6b2660acbe6ee30976123b11705c3a31409f514c8af892eb1aaef056",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5515b922e3b1f53a4f22d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，是啊……第1名——呵呵……。\n对于这个符合『女王』之名的结果，我感到非常高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01383d362c732bc5f79f655a80c844758fc4fc6c763e6a94e8711478c90f0165",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1375"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7ea70531f1249023ae06243",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是嘛……能让您感受到呢……。\n谢谢，真是不胜荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2dd1989809767a2b4887b7e1a5d1450bebf6a82aa265cabb6af8a40cf26be1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1376"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b535906a03ee3139f081c69",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对妹妹们……说『下次，也请继续见证。\n我一定会赢的』——这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee39bed5a96357c6acbf3d2d72fdeacdce6cb240f3b6fe78e9532799caf3719",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1377"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717e7fe42152c56ffed146a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……无论对手是谁，我都绝无半分\n被你们击溃的打算——就说这些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8d753bd8969e7f961c7454d696e618ef32db0c48a0a19f5669a29b8eb4af81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66876ee8bb6a58f174b7b966",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是嘛……能让您感受到呢……。\n谢谢，真是不胜荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2dd1989809767a2b4887b7e1a5d1450bebf6a82aa265cabb6af8a40cf26be1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1379"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312e1196b8c259a7ea484c6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「心中的蹄铁会因场地良好而松动」，\\n我会胜而不骄地绷紧神经去挑战下一场竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23634093063af65f0c64ca4ffc69651b1767541244c9ed38ab8dad4f4845db1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c13e87ab1cb290e695c2b62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对妹妹们……说『下次，也请继续见证。\n我一定会赢的』——这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee39bed5a96357c6acbf3d2d72fdeacdce6cb240f3b6fe78e9532799caf3719",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1380"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f13fe6dba6bfa858eb55228",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……无论对手是谁，我都绝无半分\n被你们击溃的打算——就说这些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8d753bd8969e7f961c7454d696e618ef32db0c48a0a19f5669a29b8eb4af81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e4c8d786b35cef786138d61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……今晚直到所有家人尽兴为止，\n请和我一起，接受庆祝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab029accb97f2b6fa6f4d9398a4a9dfa9ccbcb6a3a4db98c89beb3512ca5eb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0cdb97a2c804421027a8f1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很骄傲，呢……能让妹妹们看到……我，\n站在顶点的那一刻——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb31d6713b8c15ce45c6490b717dc5aab12af91c9cdc16e135c7203a925a7fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ce050493272916b90e1365d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……今晚直到所有家人尽兴为止，\n请和我一起，接受庆祝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab029accb97f2b6fa6f4d9398a4a9dfa9ccbcb6a3a4db98c89beb3512ca5eb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1384"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26638fd698f3812aa8b9b865",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很骄傲，呢……能让妹妹们看到……我，\n站在顶点的那一刻——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb31d6713b8c15ce45c6490b717dc5aab12af91c9cdc16e135c7203a925a7fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1385"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d9cce23f04c48aa6c5608f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，当然♪　接下来还有一场硬仗！\n回去后，我也会努力剪辑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c463e6b86dc6592629c3f40b29f27e23ef3d4f6d9af1173c78d425db847be4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c74b2061191fb986ddbd391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉丝社群的大家♡　……不过，\n不用我说大概大家也都在实时观看吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "85bfd5d8111554c031c4d3eb0823d9da25697dfb65d293e1ba1045d30d908f43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1387"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c760a9893c50d8ab319043af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，要给自己的身体注入爱。但是气味太冲的\n膏药就有点……因为太刺鼻了啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2afd73424352e5fef51992eda1a27e6399c4c13b430e45585b14a0ba9edb22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a616b3b24db42c5e9d2dfed3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶——，Love Me♡　Love You♡\n哎呀，姿势是看不见的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48610ee8bb698e09bc4692b5b8297e39dd292033fc97044d0af417b128ea9656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01baa9c3aa5adf0f8a2c9f0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈！才没那种东西。跑步然后获胜。\\n胡思乱想是三流的人物在做的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb70ab93c66a0ff056653678fddb6bf8a50baac07847a21519a7fa8ace119ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:968b0b92636f56bed7e7c572",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～，脱离预料的情况，其实不太多\n发生。因为我总是会准备5、6种方案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bd3ac92db0754851b45f010415fcbde595e094836dcd3b7f660815b3d357f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee8628a111d1ed218081a7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
