      "uid": "zhcn:66d000bba6635f6e876b34f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实是因为看到了关注的孩子，在地方赛事中获胜了\n……我就觉得，我、我也绝对不能输啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "206a409519c9826f9b915748f7905f6fbf10dac3a52e01f7089a58392c04e3aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1398"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394dfbd99ba42844f7f7c8ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家真的都很快……信念也很坚定。\n能成为大家的代表，是我的荣幸……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f55bb66b9b134b6ff4f24c2e397f7201269956935ead1ff3a4a7a052e545b2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1399"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb37466d87ce3ee8bd4ebf1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想放假！所以就把宿舍里\\n所有月历上的日子都改成「黄道吉日」啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1da0979d8b9020020c9e0595b6fc5346c2f73b7d31069c9525849cabacf3333",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6dbf7ff237da1e973f8521",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "梳理头发和尾巴。\\n护毛油只用法国制的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06924ff8b7c5fa4793d1c59e5830aa4d581e05f6f99aa7a34fd17e28688ad406",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a5c1b09debc78b45d66ae9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为、因为局势偏向了我，那个，是的……！\n但赛事也是活物……我会保持警惕的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7274c16e8cc7ee73d2135e5f9119d6de9d071d478392a1ac3103ef2ad2d4fe86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e820756dc3b4397acf4934cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是的……因为一直在调整忍耐着。\n一边看赛事……一边吃内脏煮……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "015ba8af60903c975053fc0f18f8013806698de32b5c6592d27cad639d35f85c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac33e07816eba7e9cbe8752",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去寻找的话，反省点数不胜数。但是……。\n我会，站在顶点……名留青史的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d94a721bbb0ceca6c03cc4dcd6abe74bd81686778a1911e6e0916ca63900f33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7b2fd321547dafe0df69aa6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为、因为局势偏向了我，那个，是的……！\n但赛事也是活物……我会保持警惕的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7274c16e8cc7ee73d2135e5f9119d6de9d071d478392a1ac3103ef2ad2d4fe86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
