        "232",
        "1418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c0ff261b11613426a3ea14e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家～！　朝着复仇，加——油哦♡\n不过嘛？　还是会被我们天才组合反杀的就是啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "be66ee5a7f6bdd6bf23956a3b92321483348982658e7c17bfbbcd375531d7e41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6948e8674af9b732dcb31c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很荣幸能听到你这样说。\\n……嗯，是真的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd081feef52cf215b79bba36dfd845c478040325a8ec9fe51c8115031ffb084d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:574f50bd5379616790a5a379",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先是芭菲和限定玩偶吧～？\n做好觉悟吧训练员♪　欸嘿♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "5703da90a54f24617a093c8f510284285ba3e4c724b282dfbdd1bdc0df2d9459",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
